## Next Steps
Once deployed to Vercel:
1. Speed Insights will automatically start collecting performance metrics
2. Data will be visible in the Vercel dashboard under Speed Insights section
3. The tracking script will be injected at `/_vercel/speed-insights/*` routes
4. No additional configuration required

## Notes
- The project already has `@vercel/analytics` installed and configured in App.jsx
- Speed Insights complements Analytics by providing Core Web Vitals and performance data
- Both packages work seamlessly together without conflicts
